"使用限制","Not installed or run in this research pass. Minetest Game is a basic sandbox without a single built-in benchmark goal; custom task design and a controller bridge are required.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Pin the Luanti release and exact Minetest Game commit or package revision; the game uses rolling releases and is in maintenance-only mode. Create a dedicated local test world.","Save the seed and a pristine world snapshot, then install only the required mods.","Use a small custom Lua mod to expose resets, task state and measurable success.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Create a Lua mod with a fixed navigation, placement or crafting objective and a success signal.","Evaluate a first-person agent from the same seed, spawn, inventory and world snapshot.","Add an entity or texture and verify coordinate scale, materials, collision and save persistence.","AI 使用与评估条件","Lua mods are practical instrumentation points. Record the license of every game/mod and asset added to the world; ContentDB availability alone is not a blanket data-use permission.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98,99],"evidence",{"_58":106,"_25":107},{"_58":104,"_25":105},{"_58":102,"_25":103},{"_58":100,"_25":101},"Pinned rolling-release and maintenance policy","https://github.com/luanti-org/minetest_game/blob/c42e4d0c0ff9d27ff7b9b308c3cfc14098dd3a0f/README.md","Game code and media licenses","https://github.com/luanti-org/minetest_game/blob/master/LICENSE.txt","Official game package","https://content.luanti.org/packages/Minetest/minetest_game/","Engine source and installation","https://github.com/luanti-org/luanti","查看许可条款",[111],"licenseUrl",{"_58":108,"_25":103},"许可类别","代码与资产采用不同许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Minetest Game media defaults to CC BY-SA 3.0; inspect each mod README for authors and exceptions. Other ContentDB packages have independent terms.","assetLicense","代码许可","Luanti engine LGPL2.1 or later; Minetest Game code uses LGPL2.1, with mod-level notices.","codeLicense","开始使用",[125],"access",{"_58":126,"_25":105,"_127":128},"Get Minetest Game","note","Install the free Luanti engine, then add this game through ContentDB. The engine and the game are separate projects.","主要来源",[132],"sourceUrl",{"_58":129,"_25":107},"技术栈","C++ Luanti engine / Lua games and mods / voxel worlds","stack","适用方向",[139],"dimensions","3D","测试目标",[143,144,145],"uses","代码修改与自动试玩","视觉、控制与规划","资产与动画流程","资源类型","游戏与引擎项目","lead","summary","project",[163,164,165],[162],{"_58":126,"_25":105,"_127":128},"mixed",[158,159,160,161],[86,87,88],[79,80,81],{"_58":106,"_25":107},{"_58":104,"_25":105},{"_58":102,"_25":103},{"_58":100,"_25":101},"3d","coding","playing","pipeline",{"_167":168},"documents",{"_67":169,"_35":170},[172,176,177,178,175,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,174,211,173,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229],[171,172,173,174,175],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKIL